{
    "title": "iris Dating: Find Love with AI",
    "description": "Discover a new way to find love with iris Dating, the innovative dating app that combines the excitement of romance with artificial intelligence technology. With iris Dating, every virtual date becomes more than ordinary, as AI becomes your trusted partner to connect you with people who have the facial features you find attractive. Immerse yourself in the delight of mutual attraction as you dive into meticulously selected profiles, opening the way to discovering genuine connections and experiencing true love. \r\n\r\nJoin the global community of iris Dating, an international dating platform that welcomes people from all spheres of life, united by the search for meaningful relationships, authentic companionship and lasting connections. Every day, thousands of people around the world come together on iris Dating, driven by the common inspiration of creating healthy relationships and connections that stand the test of time.\r\n\r\nThe dating app to meet new people and find real love.\r\n\r\nThe first time you see someone truly special feels like a magical moment, because it\u2019s a really powerful emotion. These moments happen at random and are very rare - you remember them for the rest of your life. With our AI dating app, we believe there is a way to remove chance and use technology to create a lot more of these magical moments for everyone.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfad How is iris Dating different?\r\niris uses cutting-edge AI to give you up to 13X higher chances to meet someone special. AI is not just a feature, it is at the heart of iris.\r\n\r\n\u2699\ufe0f How does iris AI work?\r\nAs you Like or Dislike profiles, iris learns your unique taste in facial features and finds attractive singles to fit that taste. It can also predict mutual attraction for a stronger potential match.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc98 Is it effective?\r\nOn average, women like up to 55% of the profiles iris recommends to them, and men like up to 85%. Doesn't that sound fantastic?\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd12 Is it safe?\r\niris uses an AI-powered system that verifies users' identities to make sure there are no fake profiles and no catfishing.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcb5 Is it free?\r\niris Dating is free to sign up and get started. You can purchase a premium subscription to use AI features for faster matches and more access.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca1 Why did you create iris?\r\nThe first time you see someone truly special is a magical moment, because we experience a powerful emotion. We can't stop thinking about this person - sometimes we remember them for the rest of our lives! But these magical moments happen at random, and are extremely rare.\r\nWe believe we have found a way to remove chance in online dating and use Artificial Intelligence technology to create a lot more of these special moments for everyone.\r\n\r\nMillions of singles have created a profile on iris - see what they have to say:\r\n\r\n\u2b50 \u201cHi! I just wanted to let you know because of your app, I have a Valentine\u2019s date tonight! Thank you so much. I really like the way your dating app is built. And the interface is very user-friendly and unique.\u201d\r\n- Chi\r\n\r\n\u2b50 \u201cThe algorithm learning matches really help\u2026 the relationship I found from this app has been going on for a year and a half.\u201c\r\n- Chino Asencio\r\n\r\nFollow us for dating and relationship tips: https://eq.irisdating.com/\r\n\r\nFree to download and use.\r\n\r\nView our Terms of Use https://www.irisdating.com/terms-of-use\r\nView our Privacy Policy https://www.irisdating.com/privacy-policy\r\n\r\nYou must be at least 18 years old to use",
